  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>新鲜指路石纹理</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\">此纹理包将改进<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/waystones\" rel=\"nofollow\">指路石模组</a>的纹理。</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>！资源包不会改变碰撞箱！</strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">！新版本更新！</p><p style=\"text-align:center\">过去 — 现在</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860903/description_b2f5ef29-a818-4ecb-abd4-9b415f4a3da4.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"673\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/860903/description_9ca4e4a8-e456-4e6d-a875-ccbcaa4a63b9.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"850\" height=\"516\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2024/370/17671269_l.webp\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2021/370/15194256_l.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"417\"></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:left\"><strong><img src=\"https://static.planetminecraft.com/files/image/minecraft/texture-pack/2023/370/16401062_l.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"417\"></strong></p>",
